# E09 Mechanism Design: two sequential runs in a fixed order (honest, then a lying), so the C# guarantees the order of
# every kind of line; each run is a section, every line is a fact (exact trace, level (a)).
section ^-{10,}$
ignore ^$
cover all
fact benefits ^\[(\w+)\]: My net benefits are \(([-\d ]+)\)$
fact reported ^\[(\w+)\]: My \*reported\* net benefits are \(([-\d ]+)\)$
fact message ^\t\[(\w+) -> (\w+)\]: (.*)$
fact lights ^\[dm\]: We will install (\d+) lights$
fact pivotal ^\[dm\]: (\w) is pivotal - from (\d+) - and its tax is (-?\d+)$
fact not_pivotal ^\[dm\]: (\w) is not pivotal and its tax is 0$
fact after_tax ^\[(\w+)\]: My net benefit after tax is (-?\d+)$
same benefits seq
same reported seq
same message seq
same lights seq
same pivotal seq
same not_pivotal seq
same after_tax seq
check after_tax count by 0 == 3
